            "review_title": "Review at Bún chả Sinh Từ",
            "review_text": "Pioneer57253437556\n4 contributions\n0\nThe experience is still great\nOct 2023 • Family\nBefore, I ate shrimp cakes and vermicelli noodles that were very delicious... this time I had a chance to go out with my family and saw that the restaurant had a location here so I went in to eat... the food was prepared very quickly, the dipping sauce was brought out to the guests, the meat was still hot. ,,, I ordered a roasted bird, it was well marinated, the meat was not dry... especially I really like the raw vegetables served here, which are abundant, clean, and look very delicious... I rate the quality very well. The quality here compares to other bun cha restaurants I've eaten at\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten October 27, 2023",
